# Never let secrets or local-only files enter a build context or image layer.
#
# Every pattern needs a `**/` prefix to match at any depth: Docker anchors a pattern without
# one to the context root. That is why `.env` left `backend/.env` in the context (and in the
# build stage's layer), `node_modules` left `frontend/node_modules` in it, and `*.log` left
# `backend/steam5.log` plus the Playwright logs.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
**/.idea
**/.vscode

**/*.log
**/*.log*.gz

**/build/
**/.gradle/
backend/bin/

**/node_modules
**/.next/
